  "version": "HL7 v2.3.1",
  "chapter": "Medical Records/Information Management",
  "description": "Note: The only valid use of this trigger event is for documents whose availability status is “Unavailable,” i.e., the document has not been made available for patient care.\n\nThis is a notification of an edit to a document without the accompanying content.\n\nScenario:  Errors, which need to be corrected, are discovered in a document.  The original document is edited, and an edit notification is sent.",
